This repository redistributes a Core ML conversion of big-lama (LaMa.mlpackage). The package
was published without a licence statement at huggingface.co/jerhoads/lama-coreml (commit
da9859ec149712a4bba6dfb2946f097b026bc8ec); its weights were verified here to be big-lama
(see README.md and verify_against_official.py). The files are unmodified.
